1) {koyu:Tactile paving and audio traffic lights must be installed on all pavements for the visually impaired.}
2) {koyu:I suggest that public buildings have wheelchair ramps and wide elevators.}
3) {koyu:How about publishing more books and restaurant menus in the Braille alphabet?}

